#. module: sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl
#: model:exception.rule,description:sale_exception_order_restrictions_bl.exception_rule_fractional_quantity
msgid ""
"A line has goods counted in units with decimals, like 1.5 units: they are "
"sold whole. Fix the quantity of the line and confirm; this exception is not "
