"With quantities delivered or invoiced, the order is not cancelled: "
"%(orders)s. Return what was delivered and create the credit note of what was"
" invoiced; then it can be cancelled."
msgstr ""
"Con cantidades entregadas o facturadas, la orden no se cancela: %(orders)s. "
"Devolvé lo entregado y hacé la nota de crédito de lo facturado; después, se "
"puede cancelar."

